== 1.8 Chapter 1 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [Commerce is best defined as],
  [trade and the aids to trade],
  [trade only],
  [production of goods],
  [the study of money]
)

#mcq(2, [The aids to trade exist to],
  [collect taxes],
  [remove obstacles to trade],
  [fix prices],
  [produce goods]
)

#mcq(3, [Which is NOT an aid to trade?],
  [Farming],
  [Banking],
  [Insurance],
  [Warehousing]
)

#mcq(4, [The three levels of production are],
  [goods, services, trade],
  [extractive, manufacturing, retail],
  [agriculture, industry, commerce],
  [primary, secondary, tertiary]
)

#mcq(5, [Mining is an example of],
  [a commercial occupation],
  [secondary production],
  [primary production],
  [tertiary production]
)

#mcq(6, [Baking bread is an example of],
  [tertiary production],
  [primary production],
  [secondary production],
  [direct service]
)

#mcq(7, [A haulage firm belongs to],
